      "content": "thanks but i dont know if talking to someone actually changes anything. it just feels like i'm reporting an error to a system that's designed to just ignore it. like if a file is corrupted, you don't try to fix it forever, you just delete it so the rest of the drive can run smoother. it feels more efficient that way. than just existing in this loop of nothingness.",
